  <Placemark>
   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued November 14 at 3:36PM EST until November 15 at 10:00AM EST by NWS Detroit/Pontiac MI</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Expect sustained winds up to 21 knots from the
northwest with gusts up to 26 knots. The largest significant
waves will be 6 feet with a potential maximum wave height of 8
feet.

* WHERE...Outer Saginaw Bay SW of Alabaster to Port Austin MI to
Inner Saginaw Bay, Port Austin to Harbor Beach MI, Harbor
Beach to Port Sanilac MI and Port Sanilac to Port Huron MI.

* WHEN...The maximum winds are expected around 3 PM EST Saturday
with the largest waves expected around 3 PM EST Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
